        <p>Ultrasound-guided injections, nerve dynamic assessment, and regenerative therapies are self-pay. Basic consultation and physical examination are covered by NHI.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How long is the first visit?</summary>
        <p>Usually 30 to 45 minutes. History, physical examination, and ultrasound assessment are all done in one visit.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
